{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "6ca607969f9ef4d8b977b1fad75b9ee07c4a8fb50230aa730507da1c63fd7a64", "ja": "ふ……ふわぁ～……。", "zh": "呜……呜哇～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8460004dc294b780b48f4f7aed50ee052f9e53a12c131a85e022e7924e3f39c3", "ja": "亜利沙、撮影お疲れさま……って、どうしたんだ？\nなんだか、呆然としてるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "亚利沙，拍摄辛苦了……咦，怎么了？\n我看你好像在发呆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "67afe71cf472b36b9ebc41041a5755c1a62eed55831a8de567dbe5ffc5493061", "ja": "だ、だって……{$P$}さん！　あの\nウエディングドレス、本物だったじゃないですか～！？", "zh": "因、因为……{$P$}先生！\n那可是真的婚纱，不是吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7606d453ad4acfb0c9fb97a08ba749b4dd8ac760eb0d65c3f75f0971ffc2fd25", "ja": "え？\nだってそれは、ウエディングの撮影だし……。", "zh": "咦？\n毕竟是婚礼的拍摄啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "e8f2167bc34743f1f679dad08a1861ca99dad90cc87a23a498accb19f98e22e8", "ja": "も、もーう！　{$P$}さん、\nちっともわかってないですよ！", "zh": "真、真是的──！{$P$}先生，\n你完全不懂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "f6c6a07988fa904fe199164753d1c88d2e29d4fe70ffb95eea79a61a0d3779e0", "ja": "ウエディングドレス！　それはアイドルちゃんと同じ、\n憧れでもあり、また恐ろしい存在なんですよー！？", "zh": "婚纱！就跟偶像宝贝一样，\n是令人憧憬，也令人害怕的存在喔──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "4caf5fa8a5fb0e422751b6c95a9832f11d97bcfe0d242201d9d5b6922da4916a", "ja": "ありさ、アイドルちゃんになる覚悟はできましたが、\nは、花嫁さんはまだ……まだ……！　ふぃ～っ。", "zh": "虽然亚利沙已经做好成为偶像宝贝的觉悟了，\n但新娘倒是还……还没……！呼咿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0d06a1c98c0637083a8affb3238c01b6727ac5132c957b7d8d7a553181750071", "ja": "そうか……ごめんな。でも亜利沙が頑張った分、\nすごくいい写真が撮れたぞ？　ほら。", "zh": "这样啊……抱歉。不过在亚利沙的努力之下，\n拍出了很棒的照片喔，你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "a6febb96bcc8c3c0fb7d55b652d1e3d203aa545fe8ced8d68d9c24b9b4a2231e", "ja": "いいい、今は見られません！　恥ずかしいです～！\n{$P$}さん、代わりにお願いします！", "zh": "现现现、现在还看不了！好害羞～！\n{$P$}先生，拜托你替亚利沙看好吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9d48da1f09768ffbffbca9c5f52a423de067768ed51395a9a6a263cbd8364e2a", "ja": "そうか……うん、やっぱりいい写真だ。\n清楚で可愛らしい花嫁さんに見えるよ、亜利沙。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，果然是很棒的照片呢。\n看起来是位清纯可爱的新娘喔，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "f7c19d95338b69a293924a88cb9155dcd1f6681b4840c0326aeab33298488bb3", "ja": "きゃあああああ！？　なな、何を仰いますか、\n{$P$}さん！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊啊！？你你、你说这什么话，\n{$P$}先生！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "a3856e2be087a20ad4eea09a3f1e3100544887d9b245d4efb1d0931a2f00479f", "ja": "き、今日は何の日ですか！？　厄日ですか！？\n休憩です！　今すぐ休憩しないと……！", "zh": "今，今天是什么日子！？灾难之日吗！？\n休息！现在得立刻休息才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1012_p", "source_sha256": "365057ca810234e35d96a1d71b44f104f9040d8d88bc85fd24c5c8d4e9146fe0", "ja": "いや、すぐに午後からの撮影が始まるんだが……。", "zh": "等等，下午的拍摄马上就要开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0023_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "02fffae1a2af7b498dc0db7d887ae31ea27217cd0a0a8ad59a41757ef158870a", "ja": "ありさには、心を休める時間もないんですかぁ！？\nうう……ありさの心臓、最後までもちますように……！", "zh": "亚利沙连让心灵休息的时间的没有吗！？\n呜呜……希望亚利沙的心脏能撑到最后……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
